      "source": [
        "# Welcome & Roadmap\n",
        "\n",
        "### Python → ArcGIS API for Python → Modern Geospatial Analytics\n",
        "You don't need to become a developer to use Python effectively. We'll use Python to make your life easier and then explore what becomes possible when we combine Python with modern data tools.\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "**Workshop Roadmap**\n",
        "\n",
        "| Time | Section |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| 1:30–1:45 | Welcome & Colab Setup |\n",
        "| 1:45–2:30 | Python Fundamentals for GIS |\n",
        "| 2:30–3:00 | ArcGIS API |\n",
        "| **3:00–3:15** | **Break** |\n",
        "| 3:15–3:30 | ArcGIS API, continued |\n",
        "| 3:30–4:15 | Admin Automation Labs |\n",
        "| 4:15–4:30 | DuckDB Fundamentals & Overture Intro |\n",
        "| 4:30–4:50 | Coffee Shops & County Choropleth: Geospatial Analysis at Scale |\n",
        "| 4:50–5:00 | Compare Workflows & Wrap-Up |\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook covers **Section 1: Setup** and **Section 2: Python Fundamentals for GIS**.\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>"
      ]
    },
